 docs/decisoes_limpeza.md      |  20 +++--
 docs/guia_setup_etapa2.md     |  28 +++++-
 reprocessar_pni_2025.py       | 129 ---------------------------
 src/cleaning/clean_pni.py     | 159 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 src/ingestion/download_pni.py |  35 +++++++-
 6 files changed, 232 insertions(+), 156 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 reprocessar_pni_2025.py

